| Method | Complexity | Best For... |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **PushState (Vanilla)** | Low | Quick fixes for simple sites without a router. |
| **URL Params** | Medium | Apps where you want users to be able to bookmark/link to a modal. |
| **Nested Routes** | High | Professional SPAs (React/Vue/Angular) where UX and SEO are priorities. |

