By default, opening a modal is just a UI change (state change), not a history change. To fix this, you must manually push a new state into the history when the modal opens.

Here are the three most common ways to achieve this, depending on your tech stack.

---

### Method 1: The Vanilla JS / History API Way (Recommended)
This is the most direct way to solve the problem without needing a complex routing library.

